 ## Current state — 2026-08-16

-**WP1 is built.** The contract (`src/schema/`), the CLI (`bin/`, `src/cli/`), the widget's verdict and three-band ledger (`src/widget/`), the reference fixture builder (`test/fixtures/`), 55 tests, the size gate and CI all exist. `node bin/visual-merge.js main feature --repo .tmp/fixtures/reference` computes a real merge and writes a validating report; `npm run build` generates `examples/basic.html`, which renders it from `file://` with no server.
+**WP1 and WP2 are built.** The contract (`src/schema/`), the CLI (`bin/`, `src/cli/`), the widget's verdict and three-band ledger (`src/widget/`), eight fixture repositories (`test/fixtures/`), 99 tests, the size gate and CI all exist. `node bin/visual-merge.js main feature --repo .tmp/fixtures/reference` computes a real merge and writes a validating report; `npm run build` generates `examples/basic.html`, which renders it from `file://` with no server.

-There are no hunks, no file detail, no `unsupported[]` handling, no `up-to-date` or `fast-forward` outcome, no theming, no a11y table and no browser test suite. `submodule` and `distinct modes` conflicts map to `other` because neither has been reproduced.
+WP2 added the complete [§2.5](docs/01-implementation-plan.md#25-conflicts) conflict mapping (`submodule`, `submodule not initialized` and `distinct modes` are reproduced and mapped), `unsupported[]` and its reason taxonomy, the exit-code discipline, `--allow-unrelated-histories`, and the `up-to-date` and `fast-forward` outcomes. The six `-z` parser traps each have a test that was committed **red** against a naive implementation first — commits `fbb3e98`, `bc6ee13`, `595c365`.

-The next executable unit of work is **WP2** (plan §7) — conflict fidelity and the failure modes. `HUMAN GATE M0` and the `M1` read-aloud are both outstanding; no agent may mark either done, and `docs/01-comprehension-log.md` is empty on purpose.
+**The JSON contract is frozen.** WP3, WP4 and WP5 build against `src/schema/types.ts` as it stands; changes after this are additive only, in their own commit, with every in-flight branch rebased onto it (plan §8/R8, contributing §6).
+
+There are still no hunks, no file detail, no line-level view, no theming, no a11y table, no browser test suite and no differential harness. `limits.contentIncluded` is `false` because nothing populates content yet.
+
+The next executable units of work are **WP3, WP4 and WP5** (plan §7), which are independent of each other now the schema is frozen. `HUMAN GATE M0` and the `M1` read-aloud are both outstanding; no agent may mark either done, and `docs/01-comprehension-log.md` is empty on purpose.

